{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g-tui","type":"group","label":"r2_tui [Container]","x":-19,"y":-7,"width":2084,"height":1403},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# C4 Level 3: r2_tui components\nThe parts of the terminal UI. Almost all of it is one file, `r2_tui.h` (sections given as line numbers), so every component's code link opens the repo root.\n\nFlow: bytes in (`tui_feed`) → `tui_update` routes keys and runs dirty controllers → compositor paints → `tui_render` sends changed cells.\n\n**C4 notation:**\n- `[Person]` purple\n- `[Software System]` / `[Container]` cyan\n- `[Component]` green\n- data orange\n- tooling red\n- notes + legends yellow\n- plain = external\n- Arrows read *caller → callee*, labelled *what [how]*","x":-560,"y":-460,"width":420,"height":560,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c-input","type":"text","text":"## Input parser\n*[Component: r2_tui.h:1343]*\nBytes → key events: CSI/SS3 (xterm, vt100, Linux), modifiers, Alt as ESC prefix, lone-ESC timeout, cursor-position reply for size.\nKey: `tui_feed`, `tui_step`, `tui_poll`\nCode: [[..]]","x":21,"y":79,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-route","type":"text","text":"## Update loop & compositor\n*[Component: r2_tui.h:3687, 3943]*\n`tui_update`: routes each key (palette, menu, move mode, modal, prefix, shortcuts, window), runs dirty controllers, paints desktop, docks, z-order, bar, status.\nCode: [[..]]","x":450,"y":286,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-wm","type":"text","text":"## Window manager\n*[Component: r2_tui.h:1685-2560]*\nWindows, z-order, focus, docking layout, zoom/minimize. Controllers run immediate mode; their drawing is recorded in a shared command pool and replayed.\nKey: `tui_window_open`, `tui_text`\nCode: [[..]]","x":1008,"y":44,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-dialogs","type":"text","text":"## Message boxes\n*[Component: r2_tui.h:3067]*\n`tui_message`: modal Yes/No/OK/Cancel box with word wrap; the answer goes back to the controller that asked.\nCode: [[..]]","x":1588,"y":45,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-palette","type":"text","text":"## Prefix & command palette\n*[Component: r2_tui.h:3239, 3960]*\nCtrl+\\ then a key (menus, windows 1-9, max/min, move, close). Ctrl+Space fuzzy-searches menu items, window commands and windows.\nCode: [[..]]","x":25,"y":520,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-menus","type":"text","text":"## Menu bar & system menu\n*[Component: r2_tui.h:2559-3066]*\nMenus declared by the focused window's controller (Mac style); shortcuts; ≡ system menu; move/size mode.\nKey: `tui_menu_begin`, `tui_menu_item`\nCode: [[..]]","x":451,"y":779,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-cells","type":"text","text":"## Cells & drawing\n*[Component: r2_tui.h:761-1133]*\nBack buffer of 4-byte cells; text/fill/box/shadow with clipping; wide chars, combining marks; control chars drawn as `?`.\nKey: `tui_draw_text`\nCode: [[..]]","x":1601,"y":501,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-width","type":"text","text":"## Width table\n*[Component: generated data, r2_tui.h:599]*\n0/1/2 columns per codepoint from Unicode 16.0, packed ranges (~2.3 KB), binary search.\nKey: `tui_rune_width`\nCode: [[..]]","x":1140,"y":567,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-posix","type":"text","text":"## POSIX adapter\n*[Component: r2_tui_posix.h]*\nMac/Linux only: raw mode, alternate screen, `SIGWINCH`, non-blocking read, `poll` wait, ms clock. Chestnut brings its own.\nCode: [[..]]","x":365,"y":1111,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-termui","type":"text","text":"## Escape codes\n*[Component: r2_termui.h]*\nVT100/ANSI sequences as macros: cursor, erase, SGR colours (16/256/RGB), alt screen, sync update.\nCode: [[..]]","x":968,"y":1114,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c-render","type":"text","text":"## Diff renderer\n*[Component: r2_tui.h:1134]*\nCompares back and front buffers; sends only changed cells in resumable chunks (any size ≥ 64 bytes), wrapped in synchronized update.\nKey: `tui_render`\nCode: [[..]]","x":1596,"y":1115,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tool-gen","type":"text","text":"## Width table generator\n*[Tooling: Python unicodedata]*\nRewrites the generated block in `r2_tui.h` and its checksum, which a test checks for all 1.1M codepoints.\nKey: `tools/gen_tui_width.py`\nCode: [[../tools]]","x":1140,"y":884,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"w-chestnut","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#ext-chestnut","x":17,"y":-449,"width":315,"height":198},
		{"id":"w-demo","type":"file","file":"containers.canvas","subpath":"#ctr-demo","x":447,"y":-310,"width":314,"height":220},
		{"id":"w-tests","type":"file","file":"containers.canvas","subpath":"#tool-tests","x":1581,"y":-332,"width":306,"height":226},
		{"id":"w-strings","type":"file","file":"containers.canvas","subpath":"#ctr-strings","x":2140,"y":480,"width":313,"height":236},
		{"id":"w-posix","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#ext-posix","x":361,"y":1536,"width":306,"height":203},
		{"id":"w-terminal","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#ext-terminal","x":1593,"y":1520,"width":304,"height":201}
	],
